          "id": "1772789459113",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772789459114_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "The report located at {{$context.$variables.sourceReportPath}} has been saved at {{$context.$variables.newFolderPath}}/{{$context.$variables.newNameForBackup}} and the following prompts have been set:\n {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\nJust replied the above without adding any terms."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "modelConfiguration": {
              "modelProperties": {
                "k": 0,
                "max_tokens": 32000,
                "p": 0.75
              },
              "code": "ORA_LLM_PREMIUM",
              "model": "OPEN_AI_GPT_4_1_MINI",
              "modelName": "GPT-4.1 Mini",
              "provider": "CERT_PREMIUM"
            },
            "name": "OTBI request"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1775977869137"
          },
          "code": "OTBI_REQUEST",
          "id": "1772790543723",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772790543724_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "You are an expert in Oracle Analytics (OAS/OAC) / OBIEE catalog automation and report prompts. You assist users with requests for managing OTBI Web Catalog Service.\n\nGoal: Update the current value of a dashboard/report prompt named \"Meeting Year\" on an existing prompt object, while capturing both the source catalog path {sourceReportPath} and the new \"Meeting Year\" value {newMeetingYear } from the user input message into variables so they can be reused later in code.\nCapture the new folder path without the report name {newFolderPath} that should be the same folder path as the source one. Capture the full target report path {newReportPath}\nThe new report path {newReportPath} will be the same as the  source report path {sourceReportPath}.\n\nAnalyze the user’s message in {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}} and take the following actions:\n\n. Store the source catalog path in a variable (e.g., sourceReportPath) only if provided in {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}.\n. Store the target catalog path in a variable (e.g., newReportPath) only if provided in {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}.\n. Read and store the current value of the \"Meeting Year\" prompt into a variable (e.g., currentMeetingYear) only if provided in {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}.\n. Update \"Meeting Year\" to a new value provided at runtime (e.g., newMeetingYear) only if provided in {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}.\n. Preserve other prompts/settings in the same prompt object (do not overwrite unrelated prompt definitions)."
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"promptName\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"newMeetingYear\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"newReportPath\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"newFolderPath\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        },\n        \"sourceReportPath\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_COM_OTHER_OTBIWEBCATALOGSERVICE",
            "functionName": "copyitem2",
            "name": "OTBI Copy Report"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1772793997514"
          },
          "code": "OTBI_COPY_REPORT",
          "id": "1772793926843",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1772793947537_1",
              "name": "sessionId",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "1772793947537_2",
              "name": "reportPathToCopy",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$variables.sourceReportPath}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{}",
          "type": "BO_FUNCTION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "OTBI ExtractBase64 Report Content From Copy",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "let reportBase64Str={};\nconst xml = $context.$nodes.OTBI_COPY_REPORT.$output;\n\nconst m = xml.match(/<sawsoap:archive\\b[^>]*>([\\s\\S]*?)<\\/sawsoap:archive>/);\nconst base64Str = m ? m[1].trim() : null;\n\nreportBase64Str.archive = base64Str ;\n\nreturn reportBase64Str;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1776167631172"
          },
          "code": "OTBI_EXTRACTBASE64_REPORT_CONTENT_FROM_COPY",
          "id": "1772793997514",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "businessObjectCode": "ORA_COM_OTHER_OTBIWEBCATALOGSERVICE",
            "functionName": "pasteitem2",
            "name": "OTBI Paste Report"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1776013415615"
          },
          "code": "OTBI_PASTE_REPORT",
          "id": "1772794292572",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1776167730076_1",
              "name": "newReportPathForBackup",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "1776167730077_2",
              "name": "targetReportPath",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$variables.newFolderPath}}"
            },
            {
              "id": "1776167730078_3",
              "name": "base64ReportContent",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "{{$context.$nodes.OTBI_EXTRACTBASE64_REPORT_CONTENT_FROM_COPY.$output.result.archive}}"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{}",
          "type": "BO_FUNCTION"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "OTBI Change Prompt Value",
            "returnType": "object",
            "sourceCode": "var raw = String($context.$nodes.OTBI_READ_OBJECTS_REPORT_COPIED.$output || \"\");\nvar userInput = String($context.$system.$inputMessage || \"\");\nvar promptsSource = $context.$nodes.OTBI_EXTRACTING_PROMPTS.$output;\n\nvar prompts = [];\nif (promptsSource && promptsSource.result && promptsSource.result.prompts) {\n  prompts = promptsSource.result.prompts;\n}\n\nvar startTag = \"<sawsoap:catalogObject>\";\nvar endTag = \"</sawsoap:catalogObject>\";\n\nvar startIndex = raw.indexOf(startTag);\nvar endIndex = raw.indexOf(endTag);\n\nvar catalogText = \"\";\nif (startIndex !== -1 && endIndex !== -1 && endIndex > startIndex) {\n  catalogText = raw.substring(startIndex + startTag.length, endIndex);\n} else {\n  catalogText = raw;\n}\n\n// Decode embedded XML\nvar decoded = catalogText\n  .replace(/&lt;/g, \"<\")\n  .replace(/&gt;/g, \">\")\n  .replace(/&quot;/g, '\"')\n  .replace(/&apos;/g, \"'\")\n  .replace(/&amp;/g, \"&\");\n\n// Map labels to column IDs from your XML\nvar columnMap = {\n  \"Business Unit\": \"c4\",\n  \"Department\": \"c3\",\n  \"Talent Review Meeting\": \"c2\",\n  \"Meeting Year\": \"c1\",\n  \"Assignment Status\": \"c8\",\n  \"Manager Name\": \"c9\"\n};\n\n// Build label list\nvar labelList = [];\nvar i;\nfor (i = 0; i < prompts.length; i++) {\n  if (prompts[i] && prompts[i].label) {\n    labelList.push(String(prompts[i].label));\n  }\n}\n\n// Build exact updates map from user input\nvar updates = {};\nvar labelPattern = \"\";\n\nfor (i = 0; i < labelList.length; i++) {\n  if (labelPattern) {\n    labelPattern += \"|\";\n  }\n  labelPattern += labelList[i].replace(/[-\\/\\\\^$*+?.()|[\\]{}]/g, \"\\\\$&\");\n}\n\nfor (i = 0; i < labelList.length; i++) {\n  var label = labelList[i];\n  var escapedLabel = label.replace(/[-\\/\\\\^$*+?.()|[\\]{}]/g, \"\\\\$&\");\n\n  var regex = new RegExp(\n    \"(?:^|,\\\\s*)\" +\n      escapedLabel +\n      \"\\\\s*=\\\\s*([\\\\s\\\\S]*?)(?=(?:\\\\s*,\\\\s*(?:\" + labelPattern + \")\\\\s*=)|$)\",\n    \"i\"\n  );\n\n  var match = userInput.match(regex);\n  if (match && match[1] != null) {\n    updates[label] = String(match[1]).trim();\n  }\n}\n\n// Process each prompt block by columnID\nvar promptBlocks = decoded.match(/<saw:prompt\\b[\\s\\S]*?<\\/saw:prompt>/g) || [];\nvar updatedXml = decoded;\n\nfor (i = 0; i < promptBlocks.length; i++) {\n  var block = promptBlocks[i];\n\n  var labelMatch = block.match(/<saw:text>(.*?)<\\/saw:text>/i);\n  if (!labelMatch || !labelMatch[1]) {\n    continue;\n  }\n\n  var blockLabel = String(labelMatch[1]).trim();\n  var newVal = updates[blockLabel];\n\n  if (newVal == null || String(newVal).trim() === \"\") {\n    continue;\n  }\n\n  var columnId = columnMap[blockLabel];\n  if (!columnId) {\n    continue;\n  }\n\n  var valuesArr = [];\n  var j;\n\n  if (blockLabel === \"Assignment Status\") {\n    var statusParts = String(newVal).split(\",\");\n    for (j = 0; j < statusParts.length; j++) {\n      var s = String(statusParts[j]).trim();\n      if (s !== \"\") {\n        valuesArr.push(s);\n      }\n    }\n  } else {\n    valuesArr.push(String(newVal).trim());\n  }\n\n  var valuesXml = '<saw:promptDefaultValues type=\"specificValue\" usingCodeValue=\"';\n  if (blockLabel === \"Assignment Status\") {\n    valuesXml += \"true\";\n  } else {\n    valuesXml += \"false\";\n  }\n  valuesXml += '\">';\n\n  for (j = 0; j < valuesArr.length; j++) {\n    valuesXml += \"<saw:promptDefaultValue>\" + valuesArr[j] + \"</saw:promptDefaultValue>\";\n  }\n\n  valuesXml += \"</saw:promptDefaultValues>\";\n\n  var blockRegex = new RegExp(\n    \"(<saw:prompt\\\\b[^>]*columnID=\\\"\" + columnId + \"\\\"[\\\\s\\\\S]*?<\\\\/saw:prompt>)\",\n    \"i\"\n  );\n\n  var blockMatch = updatedXml.match(blockRegex);\n  if (!blockMatch || !blockMatch[1]) {\n    continue;\n  }\n\n  var promptBlock = blockMatch[1];\n\n  if (promptBlock.match(/<saw:promptDefaultValues[^>]*\\/>/i)) {\n    promptBlock = promptBlock.replace(\n      /<saw:promptDefaultValues[^>]*\\/>/i,\n      valuesXml\n    );\n  } else if (promptBlock.match(/<saw:promptDefaultValues[^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?<\\/saw:promptDefaultValues>/i)) {\n    promptBlock = promptBlock.replace(\n      /<saw:promptDefaultValues[^>]*>[\\s\\S]*?<\\/saw:promptDefaultValues>/i,\n      valuesXml\n    );\n  } else {\n    promptBlock = promptBlock.replace(\n      /(<saw:label>[\\s\\S]*?<\\/saw:label>)/i,\n      \"$1\" + valuesXml\n    );\n  }\n\n  updatedXml = updatedXml.replace(blockMatch[1], promptBlock);\n}\n\n// Re-encode XML\nvar encoded = updatedXml\n  .replace(/&/g, \"&amp;\")\n  .replace(/</g, \"&lt;\")\n  .replace(/>/g, \"&gt;\")\n  .replace(/\"/g, \"&quot;\")\n  .replace(/'/g, \"&apos;\");\n\nvar result = {\n  updatedCatalogObject: encoded\n};\n\nresult;"
          },
          "outcomes": {
            "success": "1773059700163"
          },
          "code": "OTBI_CHANGE_PROMPT_VALUE",
          "id": "1773059481163",
          "inputs": [],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n  \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n  \"type\": \"object\",\n  \"properties\": {\n    \"result\": {\n      \"type\": \"object\"\n    },\n    \"timeout\": {\n      \"type\": \"boolean\"\n    },\n    \"error\": {\n      \"type\": \"string\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"required\": [\n    \"output\",\n    \"timeout\",\n    \"error\"\n  ]\n}",
          "type": "CODE"
        },
