            {
              "id": "1775914812487_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "DATA SOURCE\n\n* Read prompts from {{$context.$nodes.OTBI_EXTRACTING_PROMPTS.$output.result}}.\n* Treat the array order as best-match priority.\n* Iterate through the array with a working variable such as `currentPrompt`.\n* Insert the real values from each prompt object.\n\nLAYOUT INSTRUCTIONS\n\n* Begin with the sentence: `Here are the current prompts for your report.`\n* Return a single HTML table with a header row as the first row.\n* Table columns must be: `Index`, `Label`, `Value`.\n* Align all cell content to the left.\n* Use one header row, then one row per prompt.\n* Do not create a separate table for each prompt.\n* Show null values as `-`.\n* If a prompt has multiple values, join them with `, `.\n* Preserve the original order of prompts.\n\nHTML REQUIREMENTS\n\n* Output a single `<table>` element inside a wrapping `<div>`.\n* Use inline styles exactly as follows for the table:\n  `border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:0;width:100%;border-radius:10px;overflow:hidden;border:1px solid #ddd;table-layout:auto;background-color:#fbf9f8`\n* Use `<thead>` for the header row and `<tbody>` for the data rows.\n* Each row must contain exactly three cells.\n* Left cell content: `#<index>` using 1-based numbering.\n* Middle cell content: prompt label.\n* Right cell content: prompt value(s).\n\nFOOTER\n\n* After the table, close the wrapping `<div>` and append:\n  `<br>To change the value of some prompts, provide prompt label with new value separated by a comma (e.g. Meeting Year=2022,Manager Name=Feitty, Curtis)`\n\nOUTPUT CONSTRAINTS\n\n* Return a single HTML string.\n* No markdown fences, bullet lists, or commentary.\n* Preserve all inline styles exactly so the output renders consistently.\n* Do not invent data; pull strings directly from each prompt object and leave any missing fields blank.\n* Never output literal variable expressions such as `$context...`; substitute the actual value or omit the line when a field is missing."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM"
        },
        {
          "metadata": {
            "name": "Set Prompt Done True"
          },
